+# 2.2.0
+
+- From Shopware 6.6.6, vary the HTTP cache by price group, so customers of a price group no longer get pages cached for guests. Older releases keep the previous behaviour.
+- Send the cache variant of a page in the `X-Swag-Cache-Variant` header.
+
 # 2.1.0
 
 - Show the price group of the customer in the account overview.
